## What goes here

Domain-specific patterns, principles, playbooks, templates, checklists, and references that other federation warehouses + forged apps consume via MCP.

## Authoring

Every entry under `content/<slug>/` has:

- `frontmatter.yaml` — schema-validated per `@nexural/schema` `ContentFrontmatter`
- `body.md` — the actual content (markdown)

Run `pnpm validate` to schema-check before commit. Pre-commit hook does this automatically.

## MCP

This warehouse exposes its content via an MCP server in `mcp-server/`. The router federates it (per ARCHITECTURE §4.2).

